<title>CHINA: Paribas to open Shanghai branch.</title>
<headline>Paribas to open Shanghai branch.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Banque Paribas has received approval from China's central bank to upgrade its representative office in Shanghai to a branch, a bank official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It will be the bank's first full branch in China and is due to open in 1997, she said.</p>
<p>The bank also has representative offices in Dalian, Beijing and Guangzhou, she said but gave no more details.</p>
</text>
